# ============================================================================
# THE SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH for the spoofed device identity.
#
# PIF/Integrity Box reads this to spoof Build.* for Play Services, AND
# 00-make-fakes.sh / 01-avd-prop-spoof.sh derive EVERY other spoof from it
# (per-partition props, the bind-mounted /vendor/build.prop, dt_compatible,
# security_patch.txt). Editing the fields below is the ONLY place the device
# identity changes — everything else follows on the next cold reboot.
#
# 2026-09-23: replaced the tokay (Pixel 9) profile with the comet
# (Pixel 9 Pro Fold) profile taken VERBATIM off the avd-cloud-portable stack
# while that stack was passing MEETS_BASIC_INTEGRITY + MEETS_DEVICE_INTEGRITY.
# See docs/CROSS-STACK-2026-09-23.md. Paired with Integrity Box v42, which
# replaced PlayIntegrityFork v18 (same module id, so same path).
#
# NOTE the spoof flags differ from the old PIF v18 set in three places, two of
# them INVERTED:  spoofProvider 1 -> 0,  spoofSignature 0 -> 1,  + spoofPixel=1.
# spoofApps / spoofPixel only exist under Integrity Box.
#
# The profile carries a stated expiry. When it lapses, take a current one from
# a working source rather than running autopif on this AVD (see REPRODUCTION §7).
# ============================================================================
# Build Fields
MANUFACTURER=Google
MODEL=Pixel 9 Pro Fold
FINGERPRINT=google/comet_beta/comet:CANARY/ZP11.260821.010/16290768:user/release-keys
BRAND=google
PRODUCT=comet_beta
DEVICE=comet
RELEASE=CANARY
ID=ZP11.260821.010
INCREMENTAL=16290768
TYPE=user
TAGS=release-keys
SECURITY_PATCH=2026-09-05
DEVICE_INITIAL_SDK_INT=32

# System Properties
*.build.id=ZP11.260821.010
*.security_patch=2026-09-05
*api_level=32

# Advanced Settings
verboseLogs=0
spoofApps=0
spoofBuild=1
spoofProps=1
spoofProvider=0
spoofSignature=1
spoofVendingFinger=1
spoofVendingSdk=0
spoofPixel=1

# Released On: 2026-09-16
# Estimated Expiry: 2026-10-28
